<title>AUSTRALIA: GOLF-VICTORIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-VICTORIAN OPEN SECOND ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the</p>
<p>second round of the Victorian Open golf tournament at the par-72</p>
<p>Victorian Golf Club on Friday (Australian unless stated):</p>
<p>136 Stephen Leaney 64 72</p>
<p>138 Euan Walters 69 69</p>
<p>139 Paul Barnsley 71 68, Rodney Pampling 71 68, Terry</p>
<p>Price 68 71</p>
<p>140 Daniel Chopra (Sweden) 71 69, Roland Baglin 74 66, Shane</p>
<p>Tait 67 73, Stephen Collins 69 71</p>
<p>141 Anthony Painter 71 70, Stuart Cage (Britain) 72 69, Gary</p>
<p>Evans (Britain) 71 70, Stephen Allan 72 69, Jarrod Moseley</p>
<p>73</p>
<p>68, Michael Clayton 71 70, Rob Whitlock 67 74, Tim Elliott</p>
<p>72 69</p>
<p>142 Tony Carolan 73 69, Darren Cole 72 70, Martyn Roberts 73</p>
<p>69, Geoff Ogilvy 68 74, Richard Lee (New Zealand) 69 73,</p>
<p>Robert</p>
<p>Allenby 71 71, Steve Alker (New Zealand) 70 72</p>
<p>Other scores:</p>
<p>143 Pierre Fulke (Sweden) 72 71, Jens Nilsson (Sweden) 74 69,</p>
<p>Paul Devenport (New Zealand) 66 77</p>
<p>146 Jean Van De Velde (France) 69 77</p>
<p>151 Ian Baker-Finch 77 74</p>
</text>
